    {
        "defaultValue": true,
        "description": "Append sys_id as the final ORDERBY term so paging is deterministic. Rows that TIE on the sort column have no guaranteed order in SQL, so without a unique tie-breaker the same record can appear on two pages while another is never shown — most visible when sorting a low-cardinality column such as State or Priority. Leave ON unless you have a specific reason not to add a second order term.",
